# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.angular/
**/.angular/
dist/
**/dist/
tmp/
**/tmp/
out-tsc/
**/out-tsc/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.sass-cache/
connect.lock
coverage/

